---
import PageLayout from '../../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../../../data/site';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Little Light Below — Privacy"
  eyebrow="光落深境 · Privacy Policy"
  lead="An offline game. Your expedition stays on your device."
  description="Privacy information for Little Light Below / 光落深境, an offline cave adventure by Kuan-Hao Chao."
  width="narrow"
>
  <article class="prose">
    <p>Effective date: October 28, 2026. Developer: Kuan-Hao Chao.</p>
    <p>Little Light Below, also named 光落深境, is the mobile game previously developed as 100-Floor Descent. The game does not create accounts, operate a game server, collect personal information, track players, or include advertising, analytics, subscriptions, or in-app purchases.</p>

    <h2>Information stored on your device</h2>
    <p>The game stores language, control, sound, haptic and appearance preferences; chapter, relic and medal progress; local records; and an interrupted expedition. Story progress includes restored camp features, rescued wayfarers, viewed scenes, finale completion and an optional resting-light checkpoint with pending discoveries and active play time. Landing Coach may save a practice exercise and the original course to return to. Lantern Echo may store a small recording of your traveler’s positions and active gameplay time so you can race your own successful route.</p>
    <p>These values stay in the game’s local storage. Echo routes are not uploaded, shared automatically, or linked to a person or device identifier. The game provides no account or cloud synchronization service. Your operating system may include app data in device backups according to your system settings.</p>

    <h2>Optional sharing</h2>
    <p>Sharing happens only when you choose the Share action. A challenge contains the game name, result, mode, course seed, traveler and rules version; a Daily challenge also contains its challenge date. The operating system lets you choose a destination. The game does not add your name, account, contact list, location or device identifier.</p>

    <h2>Network and device capabilities</h2>
    <p>Gameplay works offline. The game uses local audio and optional haptic feedback. It does not request access to the camera, microphone, location, contacts, or photo library. Opening a Support or Privacy link uses your system browser and a network connection. The website host processes normal web requests when you visit these pages.</p>

    <h2>Deleting local data</h2>
    <p>To delete local game data, use Delete App on iOS, or Clear storage / uninstall on Android. iOS Offload App retains its documents and data. These operating-system actions remove local progress and Coach/Echo data; device backups follow your system settings. There is no developer account or server copy from which we can recover a lost expedition.</p>

    <h2>Children and policy updates</h2>
    <p>The game does not collect personal information from children or other players. It contains mild fantasy cave hazards and has no chat or user-generated content. If the game’s data practices change, this policy will be updated with a new effective date.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For privacy questions, email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>. You can also read the <a href="/games/little-light-below/support/">support guide</a>.</p>

    <section lang="zh-Hant" aria-label="繁體中文隱私摘要">
      <h2>繁體中文隱私摘要</h2>
      <p>《光落深境》是 Kuan-Hao Chao 開發的離線遊戲，前身名稱為 100-Floor Descent。遊戲無帳號、廣告、分析追蹤或內購，不收集個人資料，也不營運遊戲伺服器。</p>
      <p>設定、造型、章節與遺物進度、紀錄、中斷的探險、落點教練的返回課程，以及「燈火回聲」的角色位置與遊玩時間都儲存在本機。故事進度也包含營地修復、救援、已閱讀故事、結局，以及休息燈檢查點、待帶回的發現與累積遊玩時間。「燈火回聲」不會自動上傳或分享。系統備份是否包含遊戲資料，取決於你的作業系統設定。</p>
      <p>只有你按下分享時，遊戲才會交由系統分享課程代碼與遊戲結果，不會加入姓名、帳號或裝置識別資訊。遊戲不要求相機、麥克風、位置、通訊錄或照片權限。開啟支援與隱私網頁會使用系統瀏覽器及網路。</p>
      <p>若要清除本機進度及練習／回聲資料，請在 iOS 使用「刪除 App」，或在 Android 使用系統的「清除儲存空間」或解除安裝。iOS 的「卸載 App」會保留資料。若有隱私問題，請聯絡 <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>。生效日期：2026 年 10 月 28 日。</p>
    </section>
  </article>
</PageLayout>
